        <body>
            <div xml:id="d339">

                <pb facs="0557" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v02/pg511"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.5914/219½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">27 March, 1917</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I entirely approve. In
                    view of recent despatches from Denmark, would it be possible to complete the
                    transfer before the Congress meets,—I mean, of course, so far as the payment of
                    the money is concerned and the formal transfer of title? I hope that this can be
                    arranged.</p>
                <p>Faithfully Yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. W.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
